 "comment": "One immutable machine aggregate per fresh fail-closed n=20 cohort, collocating cohort id, the exact successful run-id sequence, the exact image repository@digest identity, qualification/cleanup/outcome, and the qualification-contract hashes. Constructed in-repo from the committed cohort artifacts because the harness did not emit a collocated aggregate; the builder verifies EVERY field for exact equality against the committed sources (cohort TSV bytes, aggregator APPROVED_CONTRACTS, published COHORTS record, catalog row digest) and refuses the build on any drift, rebinding, or sequence change. The OpenFold2 qualification image is a private-mirror reference sharing the exact digest; the full reference string is withheld from published artifacts per the sanitization policy and is bound by image_ref_sha256 instead.",
